Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:39.58,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“In dev tools, unique gets
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:39.58,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}tried. The work is keeping
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:39.58,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}the buzz.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,So, Cline started at a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,hackathon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:03.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:04.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Our founder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:06.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Saoud, built it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Cline had an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,interesting advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,that made things easier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:13.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,It was a developer tool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:16.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it was the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:18.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,real approach at a truly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:19.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,like chat-based agentic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:20.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,coding agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:21.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everything was basically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:22.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,auto-complete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,tab auto-complete then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:26.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,so it was unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,And in developer tools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,if you have something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:30.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,unique, people are going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:31.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,You don't really have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,work for those first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,users. It's more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,can you keep that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,initial buzz and keep it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,going, and we were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:38.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,successful in doing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:39.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,that.
